diff --git a/topics/session-defaults.md b/topics/session-defaults.md
index 113bc652..83e93755 100644
--- a/topics/session-defaults.md
+++ b/topics/session-defaults.md
@@ -66,0 +67,8 @@ not overwrite per-provider model/thinking/effort choices.
+### Live session controls
+
+For an owned live session, a model's service-tier choices belong in the same
+composer popover as Thinking Mode and Effort Level. The current process tier is
+selected when the popover opens. Choosing Standard or a provider tier such as
+Fast reconfigures the active process for the next turn and keeps the composer
+control synchronized if that reconfiguration replaces the process.
+
